WEBVTT

00:14.370 --> 00:15.640
Just one.

00:19.530 --> 00:21.900
I'm not smoking. It's bad for your bones.

00:21.900 --> 00:26.150
I wish you would. I get the feeling 
we're gonna be together for a while.

00:31.710 --> 00:33.420
Just one, then.

00:34.010 --> 00:37.250
This is the first and last 
cigarette I ever light up.

00:37.250 --> 00:39.850
Yes! Let me get that for you.

00:40.860 --> 00:44.320
You're kind of awful, making 
someone who's underage smoke.

00:44.320 --> 00:45.980
You're underage?!

00:45.980 --> 00:47.240
Yeah...

00:47.240 --> 00:50.510
Well, you obviously can't smoke, then!

00:55.960 --> 00:57.020
Hand it over.

01:00.020 --> 01:03.390
I'll hang onto this one for you, then.

01:05.910 --> 01:11.120
Once you grow up and you're ready 
to develop an addiction, I'll give it back.

02:25.600 --> 02:29.520
The Ghost Devil doesn't have eyes, 
so it uses fear to see.

02:30.490 --> 02:32.590
Himeno explained that to me.

02:50.870 --> 02:51.900
Himeno...

02:54.480 --> 02:56.010
I'll be with you soon.

05:09.980 --> 05:10.780
Snake—

05:10.780 --> 05:11.710
Don't kill her.

05:30.070 --> 05:33.560
Kobeni, why'd you stay with Public Safety?

05:38.390 --> 05:40.950
Bonuses are coming up soon, so...

05:58.460 --> 06:00.460
Barf!

06:02.660 --> 06:04.210
Meat is meat!

06:04.210 --> 06:06.550
It matters not if it is porcine, 
bovine, or human!

06:06.550 --> 06:08.270
It sure as hell does!

06:09.850 --> 06:13.060
We're here to catch that Samurai Sword dude.

06:13.360 --> 06:15.430
You better not try to eat him when we do.

06:17.030 --> 06:18.470
Damn it...

06:28.230 --> 06:30.140
They haven't noticed us.

06:30.140 --> 06:32.010
Don't make any noise.

06:34.660 --> 06:36.540
I am the one called Power!

06:37.410 --> 06:38.870
These, I can defeat.

06:38.870 --> 06:40.250
Have at thee!

06:42.360 --> 06:44.380
After me, Denji!

06:44.900 --> 06:46.590
I entrust my back to you!

06:51.590 --> 06:53.600
How's that?! What say you now?!

06:53.900 --> 06:55.400
I have not fled!

06:55.400 --> 06:57.430
I am proud! I am beautiful!

07:00.350 --> 07:01.620
A fierce foe...

07:02.170 --> 07:05.230
Denji! Bear witness, 
and then speak of this day!

07:05.580 --> 07:08.340
For it is Power who is the greatest of all!

07:35.770 --> 07:37.560
Found you, Sideburns Man.

07:38.000 --> 07:41.310
Hold up a second, will you? 
Let's have a chat.

07:45.630 --> 07:49.710
Depending on how you play this, 
we're willing to turn ourselves in.

07:50.440 --> 07:53.570
We just want satisfaction, you get it?

07:58.100 --> 08:02.920
Denji... you killed their friends, 
and my granddad.

08:03.400 --> 08:05.710
We just want you to atone for that.

08:05.710 --> 08:10.340
I only killed their pals and your grandpa 
because they turned into zombies, dude.

08:10.340 --> 08:11.760
Don't you fucking lie!

08:11.760 --> 08:14.890
Dumbass little shits like you
 always try and lie!

08:16.550 --> 08:18.060
Y'know what? Fine.

08:18.060 --> 08:21.070
Even if that's true...

08:21.070 --> 08:23.020
Those zombies used to be people, too.

08:23.450 --> 08:26.650
You seriously don't feel bad, 
after killing them?

08:27.040 --> 08:28.150
Sure don't.

08:30.730 --> 08:33.460
Sawatari's put me through the ringer, too.

08:33.460 --> 08:37.020
Apparently my heart was replaced 
with the Katana Devil.

08:37.860 --> 08:39.940
But even I have trouble sleeping

08:39.940 --> 08:43.830
on nights when I've accidentally 
killed zombies, man.

08:44.910 --> 08:49.040
Looks like you're the only one 
whose heart's not human anymore.

08:49.390 --> 08:52.300
If you've got any kind of conscience left...

08:52.920 --> 08:55.450
Just let us kill you.

09:01.790 --> 09:02.930
Nah.

09:04.870 --> 09:06.290
Okay.

09:07.060 --> 09:09.230
Then I'm gonna cut you to pieces!

09:09.230 --> 09:11.400
Go ahead and try, dumbass!

09:19.970 --> 09:20.780
What?!

09:20.780 --> 09:23.290
I thought you were gonna cut me up!

09:23.290 --> 09:24.410
How about it?!

09:31.890 --> 09:33.120
Die!

09:37.710 --> 09:39.050
Damn it...

10:18.200 --> 10:20.680
You're looking sharper than before...

10:20.680 --> 10:24.630
Denji, what are you even fighting for?

10:25.620 --> 10:29.190
To protect the life I've got now, I guess?

10:29.520 --> 10:33.320
Public Safety got you living 
the good life, is that it?

10:35.680 --> 10:38.950
Gotta put up with a nag and a brat...

10:38.950 --> 10:40.890
But I like it pretty good.

10:41.950 --> 10:46.450
Which is why I've gotta kick your ass, 
so Ms. Makima will praise me.

10:47.890 --> 10:50.080
You can't beat me, man.

10:50.480 --> 10:53.540
What, you think you've got me beat already?

10:53.540 --> 10:55.300
I ain't dead yet!

10:55.300 --> 10:56.300
You trash!

11:20.530 --> 11:21.530
Where the hell is he?

11:26.490 --> 11:27.860
Due to an incident in one of the cars,

11:27.070 --> 11:29.220
Get... off!

11:27.860 --> 11:30.830
the train will now come 
to an emergency stop.

11:30.830 --> 11:34.630
The doors will open, so please 
evacuate in an orderly fashion.

11:34.630 --> 11:38.800
I repeat, due to an incident 
in one of the cars...

11:45.480 --> 11:46.560
Aw, come on, dude!

12:02.650 --> 12:05.370
Look... can we ban that move? Seriously.

12:05.730 --> 12:06.780
Keep yapping.

12:16.570 --> 12:18.130
You're done.

12:18.780 --> 12:20.770
Can't even fight anymore.

12:21.530 --> 12:22.690
How about it, Denji?

12:24.460 --> 12:29.000
Care to apologize for killing 
Granddad before you die?

12:36.100 --> 12:38.060
I can still fight.

12:41.720 --> 12:45.080
I've still got a chainsaw on my head!

12:45.080 --> 12:46.140
Dumbass!

12:56.990 --> 13:00.040
Didn't Granddad teach you...

13:00.040 --> 13:01.950
About when to know when you're beat?

13:03.810 --> 13:08.850
Beg for his forgiveness, 
and I'll make it quick.

13:14.330 --> 13:17.670
You went right after my head...

13:18.530 --> 13:21.110
Thanks for that, dipshit!

13:28.150 --> 13:30.700
Didn't the geezer teach you...

13:31.980 --> 13:37.710
that beasts shouldn't trust 
anything a hunter says?!

14:10.670 --> 14:12.280
Guess you're awake.

14:15.150 --> 14:18.400
You really are like me, huh?

14:19.210 --> 14:21.650
Pulled that katana out of your arm,

14:21.650 --> 14:23.950
and the halves of your body 
stuck back together.

14:26.030 --> 14:27.510
I'll kill you...

14:27.510 --> 14:29.380
You're fucking dead!

14:29.820 --> 14:32.360
Losers sure love to make noise, huh?

14:33.060 --> 14:38.060
We've got a while until 
the cops show up to grab you.

14:38.990 --> 14:41.650
And to be honest, 
I'm not really satisfied yet.

14:43.410 --> 14:45.800
You killed Himeno.

14:46.390 --> 14:50.940
That's one less hot lady in the world, 
thanks to your stupid ass.

14:51.770 --> 14:55.930
But you don't seem to care, and you'll 
get to spend the rest of your life in jail.

14:56.540 --> 14:58.820
How am I supposed to deal with that?

14:59.780 --> 15:04.670
Not like you can do anything about it. 
You're just Public Safety's lapdog!

15:11.180 --> 15:13.200
We're about to have us a contest.

15:15.740 --> 15:16.970
Contest?

15:16.970 --> 15:19.840
Hey, great timing.

15:22.230 --> 15:23.920
This is Hayakawa from Division 4.

15:23.920 --> 15:27.820
Target is restrained on the train tracks in front of the clock tower.

15:27.820 --> 15:28.970
Requesting backup.

15:29.520 --> 15:31.990
You wanna get in on this, too, Hayakawa?

15:31.990 --> 15:34.190
It's gonna be the best contest ever.

15:34.190 --> 15:36.090
What the hell are you talking about?

15:38.940 --> 15:41.940
See, he shot at Himeno...

15:41.940 --> 15:44.830
So I figure we get to take shots at him.

15:46.710 --> 15:48.960
That's why we'll make it a contest.

15:49.330 --> 15:52.220
We take turns giving him nut shots,

15:52.550 --> 15:56.970
and whoever gets him to scream the loudest 
before the cops show up is the winner.

15:56.970 --> 15:58.470
What are you, psycho?!

16:06.910 --> 16:08.360
You in or what?

16:10.040 --> 16:13.510
Our job is to catch this guy.

16:14.530 --> 16:16.840
Not torture him to make 
ourselves feel better.

16:18.310 --> 16:22.090
It's not like Himeno would've wanted that.

16:24.130 --> 16:25.880
That right?

16:50.600 --> 16:51.400
So...

16:53.400 --> 16:55.160
What do I get if I win?

16:56.280 --> 16:59.050
His family jewels, of course!

17:01.670 --> 17:02.670
Hey...

17:03.650 --> 17:04.680
Hang on, hang on!

17:05.240 --> 17:06.750
Don't do it, come on—

17:14.920 --> 17:17.430
Car #2

17:14.920 --> 17:17.430
Metro PD

17:42.850 --> 17:46.150
Himeno... Can you hear this up in heaven?

17:50.940 --> 17:54.800
We're playing a requiem for you.

18:01.280 --> 18:04.780
These terrorist attacks 
were arranged by Akane Sawatari,

18:04.780 --> 18:07.980
a Devil Hunter formerly 
from the private sector.

18:08.310 --> 18:12.940
She had a contract with the Gun Devil, 
and distributed guns to the yakuza.

18:13.410 --> 18:19.110
In exchange, Sawatari was told 
to recover the Chainsaw Devil's heart.

18:19.470 --> 18:25.120
And why exactly was Sawatari 
after the Chainsaw Devil's heart?

18:25.420 --> 18:27.800
Before we were able to question her...

18:34.180 --> 18:35.500
Suicide?

18:35.500 --> 18:40.510
Triggered automatically by the terms 
of her contract with the Gun Devil, maybe.

18:41.120 --> 18:46.360
We were able to recover 1.4 kilograms 
of Gun Devil flesh from the building.

18:46.840 --> 18:50.600
After combining that with the 
five kilograms held by Public Safety,

18:50.910 --> 18:54.020
the flesh chunk has finally begun 
to move toward the main body.

18:54.830 --> 18:57.030
Then the time has come...

18:57.480 --> 18:59.380
Where is it headed toward?

22:52.120 --> 22:53.770
I have this dream all the time.

22:56.750 --> 22:58.040
I always have it,

22:59.440 --> 23:01.340
and then I always forget it.

23:03.460 --> 23:04.440
Denji.

23:05.750 --> 23:06.720
Pochita?

23:07.190 --> 23:09.710
Pochita, come on out!

23:09.710 --> 23:12.050
I can at least pet you in a dream.

23:13.200 --> 23:14.140
Denji.

23:15.240 --> 23:17.210
You can't open that door.

23:43.740 --> 23:45.460
Tell me, Denji...

23:46.210 --> 23:49.370
Between the country mouse 
and the city mouse...

23:50.600 --> 23:51.990
Which would you rather be?
